5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about relying on conditions we cannot control, like weather or transport.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The location of our branches already dictates who can reach us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why do we keep judging new ideas by how they sound?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Budgets often look fine on the day, but thin by year two.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must check if staff actually have the skills for new tasks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that sounds familiar. I have seen timetables crumble before.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Rin, perhaps we should look at what has already been tried.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,Yes! I want to see the records of old programmes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the funding terms to see where the gaps are.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I need to check the volunteer register and training records.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will check the winter road closures to see how access failed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the bus links in the outer wards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the running and equipment lines.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,It is important to know what breaks when the weather turns.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Quietly, I hope the data shows where the gaps are.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I am excited to see if the old stops were actually popular.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we should verify the numbers before voting.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed. We cannot assume competence without checking the roster.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
