35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads north were shut for eleven days, but halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The outer wards lost their bus link; residents face an hour's round trip.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Old outreach stops averaged forty visitors, more than the main building midweek.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The vehicle line overran by a third, but equipment came in under budget.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"We have retired tradespeople, but no one trained to supervise outside facilitators.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that bus loss is severe. It isolates those wards completely.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes. And evening bookings are full, but remote use peaks later.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, if the vehicle costs are high, is a mobile branch viable?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, the grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it hits the budget.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, the old groups still meet unaided, which is promising for community-led models.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am concerned about the reliability of a vehicle-based service given the road closures.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"A mobile service might help the outer wards, but the cost is worrying.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"The attendance data suggests people want the service, even if the old one lapsed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"We need a sustainable funding model, not just a one-year grant.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"If we choose a program needing facilitators, we have a supervision gap.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Perhaps a service that doesn't depend on a single vehicle is safer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The digital portal might reach people who can't travel, but scanning is slow.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,"The maker workshop has tools ready, but who supervises?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The endowment covers capital, but operating costs are the real risk.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,We must pick something that fits our current staff capabilities.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
