60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am leaning towards the Language Circles, as they rely on community partners.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The Digital Archive seems good for reach, but the delivery windows are risky.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
