75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I hope this brings peace and connection to our community.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Quietly, I hope the archive serves those who cannot visit.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Rin,,"I hope the mobile branch reaches everyone, even if it is hard.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us hope the budget holds up this time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,We will monitor the implementation closely to ensure success.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
